4:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-stone-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Built on Next.js 16 with TypeScript, Prisma ORM, and Tailwind CSS. Data is stored on Neon Postgres (serverless PostgreSQL). All remedy data lives server-side — it is never exposed in the frontend bundle, and every API request is authenticated before data is returned."}]
